  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Image of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Translating&nbsp;it <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> units along positive direction of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis it becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0092_b8c258e528b0.png\" style=\"width: 306px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Now, applying Rotation theorem</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Multiplying the complex numbers we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>"
  }
